WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.170
Oh, God, no. Please, just. Just Cobro.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:04.470
Sorry?

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:04.480
Yeah.

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:10.410
The "the" makes me sound like an asshole. Like
The Rock or the Pope.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:11.090
