00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.250
Just don't upstage me. I'm kidding.

00:00:19.790 --> 00:00:23.120
I'm kidding. No, I'm honored to work with
you.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:27.590
Oh, well, my friends are just beside
themselves that I'm going to get to work with the cobro.

